      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze the pipeline metrics gotten from the previous nodes : {{ $json.data }}\n\nIdentify the bottleneck stage (Interview, Offer, Screening).\nGive 4 useful recommendations to improve hiring speed.\n\nFormat the output as valid HTML (use <ul> for lists and <b> for bolding).\n",
